    "title": "Free Chipotle Friday? How to buy one, get one free today in NJ",
    "text": "March 13, 2026, 12:13 p.m. ETWant free Chipotle today, Friday, March 13? Your (real or fake) tattoo can get you an epic Chipotle Friday the 13th deal today in New Jersey, you just have to head there before the deal ends this afternoon.You've got one hour today to get a buy one, get one free Chipotle deal, so let's make this fast. While Friday 13th tattoo deals are notorious on the mysterious \"holiday,\" today's Friday the 13th Chipotle deal is a play off the famous \"tatted like a Chipotle bag\" meme that originated from a TikTok video and 2019 post on X that compared Adam Levine's tattoos to a Chipotle bag.Here's what to know about the free Chipotle deal today, how to check out the Chipotle menu, what the Chipotle BOGO deal is, and how to find a Chipotle near you.Is there free Chipotle March 13? Chipotle deals todayYes! You can snag free Chipotle today, Friday the 13th with a Chipotle BOGO deal at participating restaurants. While Friday the 13th tattoo deals are all the rage any time Friday 13th comes around, Chipotle's tattoo deal comes from the famous internet meme \"tatted like a Chipotle bag.\"How to get Chipotle buy one, get one free dealTo unlock the buy one, get one free deal at Chipotle today, March 13, show your fake or real tattoo to an employee in-restaurant during the one-hour \"flash\" window of time.The fine print: The Chipotle deal is limited to five free menu items per check, in-store only, and subject to availability. You can only earn the free item with the purchase of a full-priced entrée of equal or greater value, not including kids' meals.What time does the Chipotle Friday 13th deal end?To get Chipotle's BOGO deal, be sure be at your nearest Chipotle between 3 p.m. and 4 p.m. ET today, Friday, March 13. The Chipotle Friday the 13th deal is only for one hour.Do I need a real tattoo for the Chipotle tattoo deal?No. You can get your Chipotle BOGO deal today by flashing a real tattoo, a temporary tattoo, or one drawn on with a pen or Sharpie! To unlock the Chipotle Friday 13th deal, be sure you dine-in at your local Chipotle.Check out the Chipotle menuTo find the Chipotle menu near you, head to Chipotle.com where options include the new Chicken Al Pastor, high protein meals, burritos, salads, salads, tacos and kids' meals.Find a Chipotle near meThere are 110 Chipotle locations in New Jersey. Is there a Chipotle near me? It's likely if you live in the US. Head to Chipotle to find a restaurant near you.Lori Comstock is a New Jersey-based journalist with the Mid-Atlantic Connect Team.",
